            "language": "text",
            "code": "*   The Target LLM (Qwen 3.5 9b) is tested against the current prompt using the generated dataset.\n*   Performance is measured using a defined metric (Accuracy, F1, Semantic Similarity, etc.).\n*   The Optimizer LLM analyzes failures and successes to generate a refined prompt."
          },
          {
            "language": "bash",
            "code": "    git clone https://github.com/gauravvij/AutoPrompter.git\n    cd AutoPrompter"
          },
          {
            "language": "bash",
            "code": "    python3 -m venv venv\n    source venv/bin/activate"
          },
          {
            "language": "bash",
            "code": "    pip install -r requirements.txt"
          },
          {
            "language": "text",
            "code": "Set the `OPENROUTER_API_KEY` environment variable or add it to `/root/.config/openrouter/config`.\n\n**Note:** API key is only required when using OpenRouter backend. Local backends (Ollama, llama.cpp) do not require API keys."
          },
          {
            "language": "yaml",
            "code": "optimizer_llm:\n  backend: \"openrouter\"\n  model: \"google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview\"\n  api_base: \"https://openrouter.ai/api/v1\"\n  temperature: 0.7\n  max_tokens: 4096"
          },
          {
            "language": "yaml",
            "code": "optimizer_llm:\n  backend: \"ollama\"\n  model: \"llama3.2\"\n  host: \"http://localhost\"\n  port: 11434\n  temperature: 0.7\n  max_tokens: 4096"
          },
          {
            "language": "yaml",
